 — an entry index IS a position in the prefix — and the prefix's own root is recomputed over the CARRIED bytes, since voiding is about traversal and not about what the log anchored. Its entry index is reported as an informative item beside the four other void entries in range, and the result is `verified`. `propagation-complete-void-prefix-entry-control-must-fail.ahl` is the same claim over a prefix that reaches the verifying copy of that derivation.","type":"propagation-complete"},"claim_material":{"corpus_checkpoint":{"checkpoint_time":"2026-08-16T12:00:00Z","key_id":"sha256:b62e867fa2f33afe62d5d6b1642e1621d543307846b2a57b897e710919b76709","log_id":"sha256:f96bab99f35b3ca221f3f233369835c3ee222f4b2e6c00f84b3a24f840f017a0","root_hash":"sha256:6a65f8f650778f161d4c353d13b3f4cade0ed91ddee0e02f6875c1f7d86ba131","signature":"base64:M6ftMOHi9SesoP/w9UdCndM9+no/Q6pewt1cOJflZIh1FdRmYaBsJyEcShte59kNXL32z+oKTTQYuNlCZm25AA==","tree_size":38},"corpus_prefix":{"entries":[{"entry_index":0,"envelope":{"payload":{"ahl_version":"0.4","datasets":{"customers":{"authority":{"key_ids":["sha256:34750f98bd59fcfc946da45aaabe933be154a4b5094e1c4abf42866505f3c97e"],"producer":"producer-1"},"canonicalization":"jcs","commitment_mode":"keyed","key_access":"authorized-verifiers-only"},"scores":{"canonicalization":"jcs","commitment_mode":"plain","key_access":"not-applicable"}},"issued_at":"2026-08-16T12:00:00Z","keys":[{"key_id":"sha256:34750f98bd59fcfc946da45aaabe933be154a4b5094e1c4abf42866505f3c97e","pubkey":"base64:iojj3XQJ8ZX9UtstPLpdcspnCb8dlBIb83SIAbQPb1w="}],"level":"L3","log":{"adaptor":{"hash":"sha256:ea4e9a7d9f4c2286fe2a0a292e939ef6c2261c8567b3d91cd7375c5490525961","id":"ahl-test-log-v1"},"cadence_epoch":"2026-08-16T11:30:00Z","checkpoint_cadence":"PT1H","keys":[{"key_id":"sha256:b62e867fa2f33afe62d5d6b1642e1621d543307846b2a57b897e710919b76709","pubkey":"base64:7UkoxijRwsbq6QM4kFmVYSlZJzpcY/k2NsFGFKyHN9E=","valid_from_index":0}],"log_id":"sha256:f96bab99f35b3ca221f3f233369835c3ee222f4b2e